{"entryId":"1384","paragraphs":[{"sourceId":"heilprin:sefaria-warsaw:ta:1384:1","sourceSha256":"cb2f94c20358eaedfcd0685a77747eaead5b9c364ed4919529a4cdb5aa40576a","englishSha256":"219ee24e4f0c0a98074c4baead6da69598ce6f67504525162c6f82b8a4283274","citations":[{"id":"1384:1:citation-01","he":[140,227],"en":[369,389],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Berakhot_58b.2"},"reference":"Berakhot 58b:2","assessment":"The exact two-speaker dialogue attributes the consoling reply to Ulla and has Chana bar Chanilai. The received plural attribution and Tuvi variant remain reported.","evidence":[{"reference":"Berakhot 58b:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Berakhot_58b.2"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Berakhot 58b:4","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Berakhot_58b.4"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"1384:1:citation-02","he":[44,111],"en":[101,147],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Berakhot_58b.3"},"reference":"Berakhot 58b:3","assessment":"The exact Bavli repeats sixty for day and night separately and clearly has kisa for purse. The received source abbreviates and has bisā. Retain the distinction rather than adding numbers to the base translation.","evidence":[{"reference":"Berakhot 58b:3","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Berakhot_58b.3"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"1384:1:citation-03","he":[229,287],"en":[501,527],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Megillah_27a.25"},"reference":"Megillah 27a:25","assessment":"The exact Bavli gives the fast and the visit with townspeople. It spells Chana with final he here.","evidence":[{"reference":"Megillah 27a:25","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Megillah_27a.25"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"1384:1:citation-04","he":[289,350],"en":[660,670],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Megillah_28a.7"},"reference":"Megillah 28a:7","assessment":"Exact Megillah has Huna’s conditional permission and his refusal to gain honor by humiliating Chana. Preserve Heilprin’s shorter account.","evidence":[{"reference":"Megillah 28a:7","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Megillah_28a.7"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Rashi on Megillah 28a:7:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Megillah_28a.7.1"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"},{"reference":"Rashi on Megillah 28a:7:3","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Megillah_28a.7.3"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"}]},{"id":"1384:1:citation-05","he":[365,410],"en":[722,733],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Beitzah_40a.13"},"reference":"Beitzah 40a:13","assessment":"Exact Beitzah gives the audience and the Gemara’s “great man” description.","evidence":[{"reference":"Beitzah 40a:9","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Beitzah_40a.9"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Beitzah 40a:13","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Beitzah_40a.13"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"1384:1:citation-06","he":[412,446],"en":[771,782],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Beitzah_21a.6"},"reference":"Beitzah 21a:6","assessment":"Exact Beitzah has Chana raise an objection, following Rav Chisda’s discussion.","evidence":[{"reference":"Beitzah 21a:6","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Beitzah_21a.6"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]}],"inlineHebrew":[1,0,2,3,4,5],"holds":[{"raw":"ס' אפייתא ביום ובלילה","reason":"The exact Bavli repeats sixty for day and night. Heilprin gives the numeral once. Retain the received wording and record the fuller parallel.","evidence":[{"reference":"Berakhot 58b:3","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Berakhot_58b.3"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"raw":"נ\"א רב חנן בר טובי","reason":"The exact Bavli has Chana bar Chanilai. The precise Tuvi alternate edition remains unlocated.","evidence":[{"reference":"Berakhot 58b:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Berakhot_58b.2"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"raw":"ורצה ליקח ממנו ולא רצה ר\"ה","reason":"The exact Megillah gives conditional permission in direct speech. Preserve the shorter wording in Heilprin.","evidence":[{"reference":"Megillah 28a:7","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Megillah_28a.7"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]}],"notes":[{"text":"The exact Bavli has Rav Chisda describe Chana’s acts and gives the purse wording. Revised the English to preserve the separate actors. The numerical compression and reported alternative name remain visible.","references":[],"urls":[]}],"comparisonEvidence":[{"reference":"Berakhot 58b:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Berakhot_58b.2"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Berakhot 58b:3","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Berakhot_58b.3"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Berakhot 58b:4","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Berakhot_58b.4"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Megillah 27a:25","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Megillah_27a.25"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Megillah 28a:7","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Megillah_28a.7"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Rashi on Megillah 28a:7:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Megillah_28a.7.1"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"},{"reference":"Rashi on Megillah 28a:7:3","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Megillah_28a.7.3"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"},{"reference":"Beitzah 40a:9","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Beitzah_40a.9"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Beitzah 40a:13","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Beitzah_40a.13"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Beitzah 21a:6","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Beitzah_21a.6"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]}],"entryEvidence":[]}
